# Where a student device sends its record.
#
# EMPTY MEANS THE SYNC FEATURE IS OFF. The app then plays exactly as before
# and never touches the network. Copy this file to `.env` (which is git
# ignored) and fill in the URL of your own teacher's server.
#
# The URL is a Supabase Edge Function, for example:
#   VITE_SYNC_ENDPOINT=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co/functions/v1/sync-student
#
# The only secret that exists anywhere in this project lives in the server,
# never here. This file is public.
VITE_SYNC_ENDPOINT=
